      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "GRADE — the grading system a WHO guideline folio declares for certainty of evidence, and the Evidence-to-Decision judgement a recommendation rests on. Read when a folio's `Task_AppraiseGrade` runs under GRADE, before recording a certainty, an EtD judgement or a recommendation's direction and strength."
        }
      ],
